# Workspace group `document-publication`: the store's publication slots, which
# the store requires the composition to supply (service.codefly.yaml,
# workspace-configuration-dependencies). Publication reads the producer through
# the authority's hop under a child of the publishing caller's Work Context,
# through the optional producer-read binding. This playground composes no Robin
# that publishes the producer methods, so publication is off: with both binding
# slots empty the store asks for no producer binding at all, and endpoint is
# required only when a publication policy is set
# (document-runtime/publication-policy-json), which this run leaves unset.
# Filling producer-audience or producer-binding requires both.
#
# NOTE, codefly's plain-env loader does not treat a leading hash as a comment,
# so a comment line here carries no equals sign.
endpoint=
producer-audience=
producer-binding=
